#38000
The Warrior's Guild of Samsera~
The Warrior's Guild of Samsera lies in the south-west quarter of the town's Guild Way.
Features of the guild include:
A Skill and Idea Board
A Shopkeeper
A Saving Armory
A Regen and Rest Room
3 individual SOUNDPROOF Prep rooms.
The Grandmaster of Warriors.
A Challenge Room and Board
A Proving Arena.

More features may be added in the future.

Kurse, Aug'00
~
