#38002
The Path of the Fighter~
   You stand in what would be considered the 'front' of the guildhall, where
all warriors, friends or foes must pass one another to gain entry or exit.  It
is here that the warrior's guild often holds meetings to discuss the state of
affairs in their ranks, and make suggestions to improve the strength of their
membership.  A large bulletin board hangs on the north wall here, covered in
ideas on their Class.    
~
