#38003
The Armory~
   Inch thick walls of steel protect the contents of this airtight, fire, and
magicproof vault.  Outsourced to the Guild of Mages to construct before the
great Upheaval, this armory magically protects the most rare and powerful items
left here by adventuring warriors.  It is used by the guild as a give and take
system, allowing anyone to take its contents in a first-come first-serve
manner, but with the hope that useful artifacts will be left here as well if
not needed.    
~
380 1088008 0 0 0 0 0 0
D3
A large steel door in the west wall can seal the vault from all intruders.
