#38004
Hall of the Blade~
   You walk the square main hall of the Warrior's guild, where many fighters of
different Races stand about.  Race and alignment are put aside in this place in
deference to the power and teachings of the Guild itself.  While there still
are arguments and fights that often break out, the more honorable set their
prejudices aside to learn the ways of combat.    
To the west is the guild shopkeep, who keeps warriors well equipped for
a reasonable price. A steel door protects the Guild Armory to the east.
~
