#38005
The Fighter's Shop~
   Contributions from traveling adventurers and the guild blacksmith have
turned this once meager shop into an impressive outfitter for the beginning
warrior.  Suits of chainmail, shields, and assorted weaponry are hung along the
walls.  Behind a glass cabinet filled with dagger and other smaller weapons of
destruction, stands the shopkeeper.    
~
