#38006
The Practice Arena~
   The only way to become better at battle is to experience it.  While not a
perfect substitute, this practice arena can give students a good base of skills
to draw upon.  Warriors of all skill levels train other in their skills, but
there is no substitute for the feel of battle, eventually you must go out and
try your hand at it.    
~
