#38007
The Hall of Blades~
   You stand in the main hallway of the Warrior's Guild, the centre of learning
for fighters in Samsera.  Quite crowded with warriors from all over the realms,
you peer about and spot the Guildmaster and Practice Arena to the east.  To the
west lies the infirmary, where many go to rest and heal their wounds.    
~
