#38008
The Infirmary~
   Scores of cots and stretchers sit in the infirmary, the place where those
warriors injured in battle, plagued, or hurt in some other way, come to
recuperate.  Two attendants rush about the room applying bandages and stitching
wounds (rather sloppily).  Obviously, you want to spend as little time in here
as possible.    
~
