#38009
Practice Arena - Swords and Axes~
   Though many warriors prefer non-conventional weaponry, the standard of
combat is the sword, the axe being a close second.  A warrior must learn to
handle these dangerous weapons without thinking for their own and others
safety.  Through much practice, a warrior will learn to make the blade an
extension of themself.  Such more advanced skills as parry and riposte, thrust
and disarm, will become reflexive over time.    
~
