#38010
Practice Arena - Flails, Whips, and Blunt Weaponry~
   Another sphere of weaponry are those of blunt design, used to crush,
entangle, and whip, instead of slice and dismember.  Nets, flails, whips,
mauls, hammers, maces, and morning stars are all types of blunt weaponry..  
Each with a slightly different use.  Blunt weaponry such as mauls and hammers
are usually preferred by the stronger races like Ogre and Troll.    
~
