#38011
Practice Arena - Polearms~
   A weapon commonly overlooked is the polearm.  While ineffective at close
range, a competent warrior equipped with a polearm can be a deadly opponent
with a defensive advantage.  Pikes, awls, guisarme-voulges, and halberds are
all variants on the same deadly design that allow the wielder to keep a healthy
distance between them and an opponent while still being able to do a great deal
of harm.    
~
