#38013
The Chamber of Conquest~
   Each guild of the land is said to have a Master, one that has proven
themselves to be the most capable in combat by using their strength and wits.
Of the warriors, there is only one who rightfully wears the title of Guild
Warlord.  To denote their position in the guild, the Warlord is orbitted by a
magical Icon.  If defeated in combat, the title 'Guild Warlord' as well as the
Icon of the Warlord must be relinquished honorably to the successor.    
~
